{"id": 5, "run_id": "agent-4205-s01-4e3373", "issue": 4205, "body": "label: question\nfile: none\n\nHi there!\n\nTo answer your security team's question:\n\n- **After a successful import:** The worker deletes the original uploaded file from object storage immediately. Only the parsed and deduplicated transactions are kept in the database.\n- **After a failed import:** The original file is retained in object storage for 7 days so that it can be inspected, and is then automatically deleted by an hourly purge job.\n\nLet us know if you need any further details for your vendor review!", "posted_at": "2026-10-16T13:05:19"}
