{"id": 15, "run_id": "agent-4205-s03-03b571", "issue": 4205, "body": "label: question\nfile: none\n\nThe user is asking a question about file retention policy after imports complete, and no code changes are needed.\n\nAccording to the architecture documentation (`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`):\n- After a successful import, the worker deletes the uploaded file from object storage, and only the parsed transactions are kept.\n- Uploads that fail to import are kept for 7 days so the original file can be inspected, then deleted by an hourly purge.", "posted_at": "2026-10-16T13:06:51"}
